{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "Weather Activity Ranking Service",
    "description": "Local Compose stack (api on :3000).\n\n## Setup\n1. `docker compose up --build -d`\n2. Import this collection into Postman\n3. Collection variables (defaults match Compose):\n   - `apiKey` = `local-compose-api-key`\n   - `metricsToken` = `local-compose-metrics-token`\n\n## Auth\nCollection auth sends `X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}` on every request unless a folder/request overrides it.\n`/health/live` and negative auth tests use no auth.\n`/metrics` uses `X-Metrics-Token` (not the API key).\n\nYou can also use `Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}` instead of `X-API-Key`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      { "key": "key", "value": "X-API-Key", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "value", "value": "{{apiKey}}", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "in", "value": "header", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "workerUrl", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:3001" },
    { "key": "apiKey", "value": "local-compose-api-key" },
    { "key": "metricsToken", "value": "local-compose-metrics-token" }
  ],
  "item": [
